From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:10:10 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/Kconfig: rename DAMON section

DAMON is not only for data access monitoring.  It was extended for
access-aware operations with DAMOS.  It has recently further extended
for monitoring not only data access but general data attributes.  The
Kconfig section name is still calling it "Data Access Monitoring".
Rename to DAMON.

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/Kconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/Kconfig b/mm/damon/Kconfig
index 67eb1890c624e..47910e2cadf85 100644
--- a/mm/damon/Kconfig
+++ b/mm/damon/Kconfig
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
 
-menu "Data Access Monitoring"
+menu "DAMON"
 
 config DAMON
 	bool "DAMON: Data Access Monitoring Framework"
-- 
2.47.3

